  },
  {
   "id": "lead-6",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "After Microsoft acquired the rights to the franchise Gears of War in 2014, the studio was commissioned to develop new games in the series.",
   "words": 24,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    24
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1229374217,
   "revisions": [
    1229374217
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    24
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "lead-7",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Black Tusk was renamed The Coalition in June 2015, and in August released Gears of War: Ultimate Edition, a remaster of the original Gears of War (2006).",
   "words": 27,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    27
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
   "added_revision": 1229374217,
   "revisions": [
    1229374217
   ],
   "revision_words": [
    27
   ],
   "added_before_sanction": null,
   "sanctioned_words_before": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "lead-8",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "It developed Gears of War 4 (2016) and Gears 5 (2019) and worked on spin-off games in collaboration with other developers.",
   "words": 22,
   "authors": [
    "Editor 2",
    "Editor 1"
   ],
   "author_words": [
    12,
    10
   ],
   "author_sanctioned": false,
   "sanctioned_words": 0,
